  <div class="section-title">VOLUNTARY TERM LIFE INSURANCE</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">In addition to the Core Life Insurance benefit provided by the University, you can purchase Voluntary Term Life Insurance for yourself, your spouse, and dependent children. Your cost for this coverage is based on the amount of coverage you elect and your age. Please note: You may not elect this benefit for your spouse and dependents if you do not elect it for yourself as an employee.</p>

