    <li>Employee Coverage – An amount between $10,000 and $500,000, in increments of $10,000, not to exceed 5x Basic Annual Earnings. Guaranteed Issue amount of $180,000 when first eligible for coverage.</li>
    <li>Spouse Coverage – An amount between $10,000 and $100,000, in increments of $10,000. Guaranteed Issue amount of $30,000 when first eligible for coverage. Spouse Optional Life coverage may not exceed 100% of the employee's amount of Basic and Optional Life insurance combined. Coverage ends when your spouse turns 70.</li>
    <li>Dependent Child(ren) Coverage (to age 26) – An amount in one of the following options: $2,500, $5,000, $7,500 or $10,000. Guaranteed Issue for all Dependent Child(ren) when first eligible for coverage.</li>
